# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.5.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15365924:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling in jackson-core, a build-time-only
          transitive dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass (JSON Schema -> POJO codegen plugin
          used in crime-commons-schemas/crime-commons-mod-schemas; not part of any published
          runtime jar). Fix requires jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0, which no released version of
          org.jsonschema2dataclass uses yet (latest, 6.1.0, pins jsonschema2pojo-core 1.2.2 ->
          jackson 2.17.2). Tracked in LASB-5312; re-evaluate once js2d-gradle ships a release built
          on jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0+.
        expires: 2026-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15907551:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause as SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15365924 - build-time-only
          jackson-core dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass, no fix available until the plugin
          adopts jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0+. Tracked in LASB-5312.
        expires: 2026-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-18517159:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause as SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15365924 - build-time-only
          jackson-core dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass, no fix available until the plugin
          adopts jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0+. Tracked in LASB-5312.
